f ref=\"Ezra 3:8\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(15,3,8)\">Ezra 3:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 4:3\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(15,4,3)\">Ezra 4:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 5:2\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(15,5,2)\">Ezra 5:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:18\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,18)\">Ezra 10:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 7:7\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,7)\">Neh 7:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 12:1\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,1)\">Neh 12:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 12:7\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,7)\">Neh 12:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 12:10\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,10)\">Neh 12:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 12:26\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,26)\">Neh 12:26</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <bdbheb>יְהוֺשֻׁעַ</bdbheb> governor of Jerusalem under Josiah <ref ref=\"2Kgs 23:8\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(12,23,8)\">2Kgs 23:8</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ἰησοῦς</grk>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><reflink><sup>L</sup></reflink></lookup> <grk>Ἰωσηε</grk>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <bdbheb>יֵשׁוּעַ</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ἰησοῦς</grk>). head of one of the classes of priests <ref ref=\"1Chr 24:11\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(13,24,11)\">1Chr 24:11</ref>, possibly also <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:36\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,36)\">Ezra 2:36</ref> = <ref ref=\"Neh 7:39\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,39)\">Neh 7:39</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> <bdbheb>יֵשׁוּעַ</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ἰησοῦς</grk> etc.), a Levitical family-name of frequent occurrence:</p></div><div class=\"section\"><p><br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:40\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,40)\">Ezra 2:40</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 3:9\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(15,3,9)\">Ezra 3:9</ref> = <ref ref=\"Neh 7:43\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"43\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"43\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,43)\">Neh 7:43</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 8:7\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(16,8,7)\">Neh 8:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 9:4\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(16,9,4)\">Neh 9:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 9:5\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(16,9,5)\">Neh 9:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 10:10\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,10)\">Neh 10:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 12:8\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,8)\">Neh 12:8</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <ref ref=\"2Chr 31:15\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(14,31,15)\">2Chr 31:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 8:33\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(15,8,33)\">Ezra 8:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 12:24\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,24)\">Neh 12:24</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>7.</b> <bdbheb>יֵשׁוּעַ</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <highlight>id.</highlight>), father of a builder at the wall <ref ref=\"Neh 3:19\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,19)\">Neh 3:19</ref>, perhaps = </div><div class=\"point\"><b>8.</b> a Judaite family-name (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <highlight>id.</highlight>), <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:6\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,6)\">Ezra 2:6</ref> = <ref ref=\"Neh 7:11\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,11)\">Neh 7:11</ref> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sm')\">Sm<sup>Listen 12</sup></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>9. proper name, of a location</b> <highlightword>in south of Judah</highlightword> <ref ref=\"Neh 11:26\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(16,11,26)\">Neh 11:26</ref> <bdbheb>בְּיֵשׁוּעַ</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>ἐν Ἰησού</grk>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><reflink><sup>L</sup></reflink></lookup> <grk>ἐν Σουα</grk>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Matt 1:21", "book": "MAT", "chapter": 1, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Deut 3:21", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 3, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Judg 2:7", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 2, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Exod 17:9", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 17, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Exod 17:10", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 17, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Exod 17:13", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 17, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Exod 17:14", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 17, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Exod 24:13", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 24, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Exod 32:17", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 32, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Exod 33:11", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 33, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Num 11:28", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 11, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Num 13:16", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 13, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Num 14:6", "book": "NUM", "ch